{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_139_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_139","textTraditional":"一、七年，春，王正月，鼷鼠食郊牛角，改卜牛。鼷鼠又食郊牛角，乃免牛。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_139_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_139","textTraditional":"不言日，急辭也，過有司也。郊牛，日展斛角而知傷，展道盡矣，其所以備災之道不盡也。又，有繼之辭也。其，緩辭也。曰，亡乎人矣，非人之所能也，所以免有司之過也。乃，亡乎人之辭也。免牲者，為之緇衣纁裳，有司玄端，奉送至於南郊。免牛亦然。免牲不日不郊，免牛亦然。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_139_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_139","textTraditional":"二、吳伐郯。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_139_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_139","textTraditional":"三、夏，五月，曹伯來朝。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_139_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_139","textTraditional":"四、不郊，猶三望。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_139_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_139","textTraditional":"五、秋，楚公子嬰齊帥師伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_139_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_139","textTraditional":"六、公會晉侯、齊侯、宋公、衞侯、曹伯、莒子、邾子、杞伯救鄭。八月，戊辰，同盟於馬陵。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_139_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_139","textTraditional":"七、公至自會。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_139_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_139","textTraditional":"八、吳入州來。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_139_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_139","textTraditional":"九、冬，大雩。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_139_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_139","textTraditional":"雩不月而時，非之也。冬無為雩也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_139_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_139","textTraditional":"十、衞孫林父出奔晉。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}